    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Sách, tài liệu theo syllabus.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELT402 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELT402 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Introduction to Translation and Interpreting Studies</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Aline Ferreira (Editor) &amp; John W. Schwieter (Editor) · Wiley-Blackwell · 2022 · ISBN <code>9781119685326</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Tài liệu giảng dạy về phòng, chống tham nhũng dùng cho các trường đại học, cao đẳng không chuyên về luật</strong></p><p>BỘ GIÁO DỤC VÀ ĐÀO TẠO · 2014</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Tài liệu giảng dạy về phòng, chống tham nhũng dùng cho các trường đại học, cao đẳng không chuyên về luật<br>(Phê duyệt kèm theo Quyết định số 3468/QĐ-BGDĐT ngày 06 tháng 9 năm 2014 của Bộ trưởng Bộ Giáo dục và Đào tạo)</strong></p><p>Chủ biên et al. · BỘ GIÁO DỤC VÀ ĐÀO TẠO · 2014</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Tf3Fyybs8puDEnp5JGw3zqezIfreh6H2/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Tf3Fyybs8puDEnp5JGw3zqezIfreh6H2/view?usp=drive_link</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hướng dẫn kỹ thuật biên dịch tiếng Anh (Anh-Việt, Việt-Anh)</strong></p><p>Nguyễn Quốc Hùng (MA) · NXB Tổng hợp Hồ Chí Minh · 2012 · ISBN <code>0000000323779</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Training the Translator</strong></p><p>Paul Kussmaul · John Benjamins Publishing Company · 1995 · ISBN <code>9789027216236</code></p><p>Download online at: <a href=\"https://www.academia.edu/26514605/TRAINING_THE_TRANSLATOR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.academia.edu/26514605/TRAINING_THE_TRANSLATOR</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"http://dichthuatpro.com/cac-bieu-mau-tai-lieu-dich-thuat.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://dichthuatpro.com/cac-bieu-mau-tai-lieu-dich-thuat.html</a></strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Introducing Translation Studies</strong></p><p>Jeremy Munday · Routledge · ISBN <code>978-1-315-69186-2</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>A textbook for Translation</strong></p><p>Peter Newmark · Prentice Hall International · ISBN <code>0-13-912593-0</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://edition.cnn.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://edition.cnn.com</a></strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://news.cengage.com/in-the-news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://news.cengage.com/in-the-news/</a></strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://vnanet.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://vnanet.vn/</a></strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.bbc.com/news</a></strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Guide on using Gen-AI tools to support translation: <a href=\"https://www.machinetranslation.com/blog/using-ai-to-translate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.machinetranslation.com/blog/using-ai-to-translate</a></strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Project-Based Learning and Competence Assessment in Translation Training (pp 207 -228). In Technology Implementation in Second Language Teaching and Translation Studies</strong></p><p>Marı´a Luisa Carrio-Pastor · Springer · <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar?hl=en&as_sdt=0%2C5&q=Project-Based+Learning+and+Competence+Assessment+in+Translation+Training&btnG=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://scholar.google.com/scholar?hl=en&amp;as_sdt=0%2C5&amp;q=Project-Based+Learning+and+Competence+Assessment+in+Translation+Training&amp;btnG=</a> · 2016</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Adopting Project Based Learning in Translation Class to Facilitate Translator Emergent Competences</strong></p><p>Hariyanto et al. · <a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/376171453_Adopting_Project_Based_Learning_in_Translation_Class_to_Facilitate_Translator_Emergent_Competences\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.researchgate.net/publication/376171453_Adopting_Project_Based_Learning_in_Translation_Class_to_Facilitate_Translator_Emergent_Competences</a> · 2023</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Overview and challenges of machine translation for contextually appropriate translations</strong></p><p>Naveen &amp; Trojovsky´ · <a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2589004224021035\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2589004224021035</a> · 2024</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Prompt engineering in translation: How do student translators leverage GenAI tools for translation tasks</strong></p><p>Zhang et al. · <a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/392164811_Prompt_engineering_in_translation_How_do_student_translators_leverage_GenAI_tools_for_translation_tasks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.researchgate.net/publication/392164811_Prompt_engineering_in_translation_How_do_student_translators_leverage_GenAI_tools_for_translation_tasks</a> · 2025</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Optimizing Machine Translation through Prompt Engineering: An Investigation into ChatGPT's Customizability</strong></p><p>Yamada · <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.01391\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.01391</a> · 2024</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Guiding Large Language Models to Post-Edit Machine Translation with Error Annotations</strong></p><p>Ki &amp; Carpuat · <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.07851\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.07851</a> · 2024</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Training in machine translation post-editing for foreign language students</strong></p><p>Zhang &amp; Torres-Hostench · <a href=\"https://www.lltjournal.org/item/1012/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.lltjournal.org/item/1012/?utm_source=chatgpt.com</a> · 2022</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>An Adaptive Methodology to Overcome Localization Translation Challenges</strong></p><p>Brashi · <a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/353339838_An_Adaptive_Methodology_to_Overcome_Localization_Translation_Challenges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.researchgate.net/publication/353339838_An_Adaptive_Methodology_to_Overcome_Localization_Translation_Challenges</a> · 2021</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Towards a definition of transcreation: a systematic literature review</strong></p><p>Díaz-Millón &amp; Olvera-Lobo · <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080/0907676X.2021.2004177\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://doi.org/10.1080/0907676X.2021.2004177</a> · 2023</p></div>"
